# Candidate data exports. This directory is regenerated by
# scripts/export_evidence_dataset.py against whatever DATABASE_URL is set --
# including production, which means real candidate names, resumes, phone
# numbers and answers. Never commit it: git history is permanent and this
# repo pushes to a shared GitHub remote with no DPDP handling in place yet
# (see docs/CURRENT_STATE.md). Move exports off-repo with scp, not git.
